    <briefdescription>
<para>Trait that provides access to the executor inside a wrapper. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>No default implementation. Each wrapper type must provide a specialization with a static <computeroutput>executor(Self&amp;&amp;)</computeroutput> method that returns a reference to the executor, preserving cv-ref qualifiers.</para>
